  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership to Launch the Global Credit Enhancement Facility in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale - Finance for Wash</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water.org developed the concept of a global WSS guarantee facility with a country-specific pool with the International Finance Corporation (IFC) in 2019. Together, we have structured the Global Credit Enhancement Facility (GCEF) launched in Q4&#x2019;20 in India. We are now ready to scale the model to other countries, starting with Kenya. GCEF represents an important extension and evolution of Water.org&#x2019;s strategy in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
